  "summary": "Gateway profile for the Patterson-Kelley NURO: 50 objects (29 AI, 21 BI), all polled. It reads outlet, inlet, stack, DHW, header, exchanger and outdoor temperatures, safety-chain and relay states, active setpoints, demand source, boiler state, flame signal, fan speed, firing rate, error code and the BMS CH/DHW values.",
